### 2. Potential Vulnerabilities

Upon reviewing the code, I notice a potential issue in the memory allocation and management section:

```c
term_stack = (bel_node_stack*) malloc(sizeof(bel_node_stack));
term_stack->next = NULL;
term_stack->prev = NULL;
term_stack->top = 0;
